        "input": {
          "instructions": "Clear, measured, and instructor-ready.",
          "text": "Recovery continues after the immediate fix. A short follow-up confirms that the solution worked and gives the guest a low-effort way to raise remaining concerns. It also coordinates the internal teams who touched the case: front desk, housekeeping, management, and the reservation system. Without that handoff, the guest may have to repeat the story, which becomes a second failure. From a marketing perspective, follow-up is evidence that the organization values the relationship rather than merely closing a ticket. From an operations perspective, it validates whether the remedy actually restored the service."
        },
