        "input": {
          "instructions": "Clear, measured, and instructor-ready.",
          "text": "The final step is organizational learning. Record the root cause, guest impact, recovery action, and outcome in a form that can be aggregated. If late-night room delays cluster on certain days, the response is not another apology template; it may be staffing, room-status accuracy, or handoff redesign. Leaders should track recurrence, resolution time, guest effort, and whether the chosen remedy worked. The goal is not to eliminate every unpredictable failure. It is to build a service system that notices failure quickly, responds humanely, and changes the process so fewer guests experience the same breakdown."
